"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51296, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GLbLfPzHj2WpkxWs7anZ87", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51296, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GLbLfPzHj2WpkxWs7anZ87", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 52487, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JVBWe89ziSBmztHa6jjuDh", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52787, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JVBWe89ziSBmztHa6jjuDh", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52787, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JVBWe89ziSBmztHa6jjuDh", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54853, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18). The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was the failing release, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service split across versions. I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** My first attempt to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already created with the full summary, so I did not open a duplicate. It was created once, so the on-call engineer was paged once.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout. Confirm checkout traffic and error rates are back to normal.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0147Quja8DM69PZL3MJFT3UF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WGa3cAnZQrkFhhUnyUBq23", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy one currently running in all three regions. Rolling back to v2.3.0, which has already been healthy in production, so it doesn't need change-manager approval.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VmKp3e7jxgLtgPt1vw6PAL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017tmhLTfx9353STXDYhBUT8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01H6aNUv5TSxMXqbvXDEuwYX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": 